  "extractionNotes": "ZUS cover note: the payer applied on the employee's behalf for sickness benefit during pregnancy, and the benefit was granted. Z-3: employer sick pay 2026-09-04..2026-10-06 (code B, 33 days); sickness benefit claimed 2026-10-07..2026-10-13. The e-ZLA on the ZUS screen covers 2026-09-15..2026-10-13 with code B; the earlier certificate is not shown, so the sick note is collapsed to 2026-09-04..2026-10-13 (start inferred from the sick pay). Salary 2026-01..2026-08 (hired 2026-01-07, January incomplete): contractual 10500.00, then 11500.00 from April; column 7 (variable pay reduced pro rata) 431.20 in May and 169.84 in June; column 8 bonuses 5000.00 in April and 4000.00 in May and August; recorded as fixedPay and variablePay, contributionBase inferred as their sum. Earlier titles on the account (self-employment, mandate contracts, a non-insured period) have illegible dates and are not modelled. The child is not yet born and the due date is not in the file; mode is set to adjudication. Rate 100% (pregnancy) inferred. asOf = last day of the claimed period (the Z-3 is undated)."
